---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const topologyDiagram = ` Internet
    |
    | HTTP over Tailscale mesh (WireGuard encrypted)
    v
[ Traefik (reverse proxy) ]  <--- path-based routing (PathPrefix)
    |
    +--- /vault/
    +--- /hass/ (homeassistant)
    +--- /sync/
    +--- /grafana/     (Windows)
    +--- /auth/        (Windows)
    +--- /secrets/     (Windows)
    |
    +--- 30 containers total
    |
 [ Pi 4B : 100.64.0.1 ]  <--- Headscale/Tailscale mesh --->  [ Windows : 100.64.0.2 ]
    |                                                            |
    +-- Pi-hole (DNS:53)                                      +-- Docker Desktop
         +-- Headscale (control server)
     +-- Gitea (self-hosted git)                              +-- Monitoring + Auth + Secrets
    +-- TinyBot (Telegram)                                      +-- Heavy compute
    +-- /mnt/nas/ storage
`;
---

<Base title="Architecture">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-brand-light">Architecture</h1>
  <p class="text-lg text-text-muted mb-12 max-w-2xl">
    Two nodes connected via Tailscale mesh VPN. The Pi 4B runs 20 containers + 1 systemd service as the always-on core, Windows runs 10 for heavy compute.
  </p>

  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-brand">Network Topology</h2>
    <div class="border border-surface-light rounded-lg p-8 bg-surface-light/20 overflow-x-auto">
      <pre class="text-sm text-text-muted font-mono leading-relaxed">{topologyDiagram}</pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-brand">Traffic Flow</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-text-muted">
      <li>User hits <code class="text-brand-light bg-surface-light px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">http://100.64.0.1/service/</code> over Tailscale mesh</li>
      <li>Traefik matches PathPrefix rule, routes to the correct Docker container on the proxy network</li>
      <li>StripPrefix middleware removes the path prefix before forwarding to the backend</li>
      <li>Cross-node traffic uses Headscale-assigned 100.64.0.x IPs (WireGuard encrypted)</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-brand">Stack Overview</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm border border-surface-light rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <thead class="bg-surface-light/50">
          <tr>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 text-brand-light">Stack</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 text-brand-light">Services</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 text-brand-light">Purpose</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-surface-light">
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">core</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">traefik, portainer</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">Reverse proxy, Docker UI</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">network</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">pihole, pihole-exporter</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">DNS ad-blocking + metrics</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">apps</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">nextcloud, vaultwarden, mariadb</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">Cloud, passwords</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">nas</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">samba, syncthing</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">File sharing, sync</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">smarthome</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">homeassistant</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">Home automation</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">monitoring</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">promtail, cadvisor, node-exporter</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">Log shipping, metrics (Pi side)</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">crowdsec</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">crowdsec, relay</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">Intrusion detection + alert relay</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">uptime-kuma</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">uptime-kuma</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">Uptime monitoring</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">portfolio</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">astro site</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">Project showcase</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">headscale</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">headscale</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">Self-hosted Tailscale control plane</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-surface-light/20"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">gitops</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">gitea, act-runner (systemd)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-text-muted">Self-hosted Git + CI/CD</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-brand">Phase Plan</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-400">Phase 1 - Pi Core (Done)</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">18 containers, NAS, TinyBot, Tailscale, automated backups. K3s removed, swap off, zram only.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-400">Phase 2 - Windows Migration (Done)</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Monitoring (Grafana, Prometheus, Loki, Tempo, Alertmanager), auth (Authelia), and secrets (Infisical) on Windows Docker Desktop. 10 containers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-400">Phase 3 - Security Hardening (Done)</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">STRIDE threat model, Authelia SSO + 2FA, CrowdSec IDS, Redis auth, TinyBot hardening, network hardening.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-400">Phase 4 - Self-Hosted Control Plane (Done)</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Headscale self-hosted Tailscale control server, replacing Tailscale SaaS. HTTP-over-mesh architecture.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-yellow-500 pl-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-yellow-400">Phase 5 - GitOps (In Progress)</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Gitea + act_runner (systemd) on Pi for push-to-deploy CI/CD. Self-hosted Git replaces manual bundle+SCP workflow.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-brand">Key Design Decisions</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-text-muted">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-light font-bold shrink-0">No K3s</span><span>K3s removed - saves ~575MB RAM and 50% idle CPU on 4GB Pi</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-light font-bold shrink-0">No disk swap</span><span>zram only - compressed RAM swap avoids SSD wear</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-light font-bold shrink-0">No TLS needed</span><span>WireGuard (Tailscale mesh) encrypts all traffic — TLS redundant inside mesh</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-light font-bold shrink-0">No AI/LLM</span><span>Free Groq API as fallback - Pi cannot run models with 27 containers</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-brand-light font-bold shrink-0">No repartitioning</span><span>Uses /mnt/nas/ folders - safer, simpler</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
